{"name":"avalio-lite 0.10.0","tag_name":"v0.10.0","description":"\n### Added\n\n- The sheet says **✓ Saved** under the class name after every change, or **Not saved** if one failed, and Ctrl+S confirms that everything is saved\n\n### Changed\n\n- The database itself now refuses a class without a name or a pupil without a first name, as the app always has; the first start after this update keeps a copy of the database as it was (`avalio-lite.db.before-update`)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Choosing the database the app is using as a backup to restore or add classes from is refused with a message, instead of putting back an older state of it and losing what was typed since the app opened\n- The daily check for updates no longer switches **Update now** back on while an update is downloading\n- A release whose page isn't an `https://` web address is refused, so **What's new** can only ever open a web page\n\n### Security\n\n- Dependencies updated to their latest compatible versions\n\n\n**Install:** download `avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe` (installs for your user, no admin) or `avalio-lite-0.10.0-portable.exe` (runs from any folder). Copies from 0.6.0 on update themselves from inside the app. Each `.sig` is the signature the updater checks; each `.b3` is the BLAKE3 checksum.\n","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:28:16.495Z","released_at":"2026-11-15T13:28:16.495Z","upcoming_release":false,"author":{"id":4127227,"username":"Ran-n","public_email":"ran.hash@proton.me","name":"Ran","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/4127227/avatar.png?v=1794746622","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n"},"commit":{"id":"afe20a5fc221c8b11ab1618d152ea78f3de0f650","short_id":"afe20a5f","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:26:23.000+01:00","parent_ids":["a6ac4d072455d5bf945b35a962e2dab6cea93941"],"title":"[R] bump version","message":"[R] bump version\n\nchore: bump version to 0.10.0 and promote the changelog\n","author_name":"Ran#","author_email":"ran.hash@proton.me","authored_date":"2026-11-15T14:26:23.000+01:00","committer_name":"Ran#","committer_email":"ran.hash@proton.me","committed_date":"2026-11-15T14:26:23.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/commit/afe20a5fc221c8b11ab1618d152ea78f3de0f650"},"commit_path":"/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/commit/afe20a5fc221c8b11ab1618d152ea78f3de0f650","tag_path":"/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/tags/v0.10.0","assets":{"count":10,"sources":[{"format":"zip","url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/archive/v0.10.0/avalio-lite-v0.10.0.zip"},{"format":"tar.gz","url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/archive/v0.10.0/avalio-lite-v0.10.0.tar.gz"},{"format":"tar.bz2","url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/archive/v0.10.0/avalio-lite-v0.10.0.tar.bz2"},{"format":"tar","url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/archive/v0.10.0/avalio-lite-v0.10.0.tar"}],"links":[{"id":14324694,"name":"avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.b3","url":"https://gitlab.com/-/project/88228305/uploads/3f6e131779377f48dd4e029680b67f61/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.b3","direct_asset_url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/releases/v0.10.0/downloads/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.b3","link_type":"other"},{"id":14324691,"name":"avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.sig","url":"https://gitlab.com/-/project/88228305/uploads/bf4fef4fc655b585da59547342215a19/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.sig","direct_asset_url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/releases/v0.10.0/downloads/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe.sig","link_type":"other"},{"id":14324690,"name":"avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe","url":"https://gitlab.com/-/project/88228305/uploads/84ed467f16a9d139dc58f9c068780c28/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe","direct_asset_url":"https://gitlab.com/Ran-n/avalio-lite/-/releases/v0.10.0/downloads/avalio-lite-0.10.0-setup.exe","link_type":"other"},{"id":14324687,"name":"avalio-lite-0.10.0-portable.exe.b3","url":"https://gitlab.com/-/project/88228305/uploads/0371c1009cca06745a6fe40693e111a9/avalio-lite-0.